<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Overall performance trend for each LVLM starting at R<sub id="A2.T4.10" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.T4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">i</span></sub>, using Spearman rank correlation. We highlight both <span id="A2.T4.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">significant</span> <span id="A2.T4.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#149614;">positive</span> and <span id="A2.T4.13" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">negative</span> trends and use asterisks to denote different levels of significance, where “*” means <span id="A2.T4.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span> &lt; 0.05, “**” means <span id="A2.T4.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span> &lt; 0.01, and “**” means <span id="A2.T4.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span> &lt; 0.001.</figcaption>
</figure>
